    silm:hasLongDescription "The TorsoObservation is the torso-region olog fragment of Mittens: flank patch, back stripe, belly fur density and three-color torbie pattern. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TorsoObs', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

