    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "CoconeCompatibilityInventoryYonedaHomLegExample" ;
    silm:hasExample "In 'CoconeCompatibilityInventoryYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Cocone Compatibility Inventory', the cocone_factorisation arrow witnesses a typed leg between Mittens and VetCarePlan_77 under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure.; also, In 'Cocone Compatibility Inventory', the evidence_witness arrow witnesses a typed leg between VetRecord and Mittens under the mereology-as-colimit law of the Mittens cocone with cocone-compatibility triangle closure." .

