    silm:hasLongDescription "The DomesticCatClass is the domestic-cat classification class leg, kept distinct from the individual Mittens (Mittens IS-A but is not equal to). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DomesticCat', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

