    silm:hasLongDescription "The MicrochipIdentifier is Mittens's 15-digit microchip identifier as the identity leg, kept distinct from the individual Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'MicrochipID', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

