    silm:hasLongDescription "The WeightMeasurementRecord is the body-mass measurement record for Mittens at 4.2 kg recorded during the May 2026 Tartu clinic visit. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'WeightMeas', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

