    silm:hasLongDescription "The BodyMassQualityNode is the quality-typed body-mass aspect node of Mittens, before any specific value-and-unit reading is attached. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'BodyMassQuality', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

