    silm:hasLongDescription "The SleepingProcess is the time-extended sleeping process Mittens participates in each afternoon on the windowsill above the radiator. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'SleepProcess', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

