    silm:hasLongDescription "The DurationMeasurementRecord is the duration measurement of Mittens's afternoon nap clocking in at 167 minutes on the May 2026 Tuesday observation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DurationMeas', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

