    silm:hasLongDescription "The PartListEnumeration is the forbidden plain enumeration of parts that fluent prose mistakes for the whole Mittens individual. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'PartList', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

