    silm:hasLongDescription "The SpineJoint is the shared anatomical joint between Mittens's torso and tail observations, the apex of the torso-tail pushout. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'SpineJoint', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_02_sources_and_closure_sections_04_joy_of_cats_clause_unpacking_concrete_anchor%23vetcareplanrecord
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.19_mereology_as_colimit.chapters.02_sources_and_closure.sections.04_joy_of_cats_clause_unpacking.concrete_anchor#vetcareplanrecord" ;
    silm:hasLongDescription "The VetCarePlanRecord is the clinical care plan record 77 generated for Mittens at the May 2026 vet visit at the Tartu Animal Clinic. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'VetCarePlan_77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_02_sources_and_closure_sections_04_joy_of_cats_clause_unpacking_concrete_anchor%23mittensthecat
