    silm:hasLongDescription "The LegCoconeArrow is the cocone leg arrow from a typed leg origin into the Mittens apex, realizing the part-of inclusion. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'LegCocone', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_02_sources_and_closure_sections_04_joy_of_cats_clause_unpacking_concrete_anchor%23indexcategoryjmittens
