    silm:hasLongDescription "The YonedaProfileMap is the Yoneda profile map sending each leg-origin object to its representable presheaf in Set^{C^op} of probe-test arrows. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Phi', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_02_sources_and_closure_sections_04_joy_of_cats_clause_unpacking_concrete_anchor%23partlistenumeration
