    silm:hasLongDescription "The FelisCatusTaxonNode is the Felis catus taxon node, TSN 183798, kept as a typed leg origin distinct from the apex Mittens-the-cat. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'FelisCatus', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

