    silm:hasLongDescription "The FurColorObservation is the fur-color quality observation leg recording Mittens's three-color torbie pattern with brown undertones. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'FurColorObs', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

