    silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensTheCat is the running anchor: Mittens-the-cat, the integrated whole receiving every typed-leg observation through the cocone. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .

